  **Content:** HOA mailing address, phone number, and general email.\\\\n    *   **Features:** Embedded Google Map, contact form.\\\\n\\\\n**3. Private, Resident-Only Area: Document Types**\\\\n*   **Governing Documents:** CC&Rs, Bylaws, Articles of Incorporation.\\\\n*   **Meeting Minutes:** Board of Directors meetings and Annual Member meetings, organized by date.\\\\n*   **Financials:** Annual Budgets, Quarterly/Monthly Financial Statements, Reserve Study.\\\\n*   **Community Rules & Guidelines:** Architectural Design Guidelines, Amenity Rules, General Policies.\\\\n*   **Forms:** Downloadable PDFs for Architectural Change Requests, Maintenance Requests, etc.\\\\n\\\\n**4. Contact Form Specification**\\\\n*   **Fields & Validation:**\\\\n    *   **Full Name:** (Text, Required)\\\\n    *   **Email Address:** (Email, Required, Valid Format)\\\\n    *   **Phone Number:** (Tel, Optional)\\\\n    *   **Subject:** (Text, Required)\\\\n    *   **Are you a resident?:** (Radio: \\\\\\\"Yes\\\\\\\"/\\\\\\\"No\\\\\\\", Required)\\\\n    *   **Message:** (Text Area, Required, Min 20 characters)\\\\n*   **Functionality:**\\\\n    *   Submissions are emailed to a designated HOA address.\\\\n    *   Submitter receives an automated confirmation email.\\\\n    *   Protected by a CAPTCHA service to prevent spam.\\\\n    *   Displays success/error messages on-page without a full reload.\\\",\\n  \\\"originalOrderID\\\": \\\"20240521-170001-order-orland-followup\\\"\\n}\\n###REPORT-20240521-170001-order-orland-followup###\"}]}],\"config\":{},\"tools\":[],\"output\":{}}}","genkit:state":"success"},"displayName":"generate","links":[],"instrumentationLibrary":{"name":"genkit-tracer","version":"v1"},"spanKind":"INTERNAL","sameProcessAsParentSpan":{"value":true},"status":{"code":0},"timeEvents":{"timeEvent":[]}}},"displayName":"generate","startTime":1751251022249,"endTime":1751251037911.8672}